Package: globetrot
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd
Recommends: kmod
Description: Globe/Fn key for Linux: tap to switch keyboard layout
 Makes the Globe (fn) key on Apple keyboards behave like on macOS: a quick tap
 switches the keyboard layout, holding it keeps the Fn layer (Delete,
 Home/End, media keys) and allows Globe+key shortcuts. Works with KDE Plasma,
 Hyprland, niri, Sway, GNOME and fcitx5.
